$ Original two-branch teaching database, NOT assessed Cu-Ni.
ELEMENT CU FCC_A1 63.546 0 0 !
ELEMENT NI FCC_A1 58.6934 0 0 !
TYPE_DEFINITION % SEQ * !
PHASE MATRIX % 1 1 !
CONSTITUENT MATRIX :CU,NI: !
PARAMETER G(MATRIX,CU;0) 298.15 0; 3000 N !
PARAMETER G(MATRIX,NI;0) 298.15 6000; 3000 N !
PHASE PRECIP % 1 1 !
CONSTITUENT PRECIP :CU,NI: !
PARAMETER G(PRECIP,CU;0) 298.15 14800-8*T; 3000 N !
PARAMETER G(PRECIP,NI;0) 298.15 8800-8*T; 3000 N !
